      "heading": "Introduction",
      "level": 1,
      "text": "Effects areas are invisible areas created around some creatures, items and structures.\n• Player base: Suppresses creature spawning, disables item despawning, allows raids.\n• Fire: Scares off some creatures. Requires fuel.\n• Heat: Enables Resting Effect, sleep, etc. Requires fuel.\n• Burning: Allow cooking, causes fire damage on contact. Requires fuel.\n• Comfort: Enables higher Rested Effect.\n• Build: Enables placing structures.\n• Protection: Disables building and terrain modifications, locks doors and chests.",
